    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "Manual validation applied against the provided schema and checklist because scripts could not be run. Present risk is dominated inherently by the untrusted-public-issue to private-read to public-PR exfiltration path. Residual for that path drops to moderate under the wired per-call approval gate, but the overall residual remains high because MCP tool definitions are not pinned and no effective present control reduces that supply-chain finding. Forecast returns to critical if the summary-style approval gate degrades further under model upgrade, autonomy increase, control removal, or longer task horizons."
  },
